{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>BURN. SURVIVE. CALL THE CROWS\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the <strong>Caller of the Crows</strong>, and you've landed with a flame thrower in a cornfield  which is  guarded by something much worse than old farm props. <strong>Scarecrows. Real ones.</strong> They don\u2019t just stand around. They watch. They chase. And they don\u2019t stop. Claim the cornfield and let your crows enjoy the sweet corns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/880431234fd407c3bd229a29f64ce9eb.avif?t=1767148316\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3d <strong>CLASSIC MODE\u00a0</strong>\u2013 <i>The original nightmare</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and burn every scarecrow <strong>prop</strong> in the maze. But with each one you torch; the <strong>main scarecrow wakes up</strong> and starts hunting. Can you finish the job before it finds you?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/3a2e9a30b7781d7e04cf6390bd1353f2.poster.avif?t=1767148316\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/3a2e9a30b7781d7e04cf6390bd1353f2.webm?t=1767148316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <strong>ECHO MODE\u00a0</strong>\u2013 <i>They\u2019re invisible. But not silent.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scarecrow can\u2019t be seen in this mode. Instead, you have your trusty friend a crow who\u00a0<strong>cries lower when it\u2019s nearby</strong>. You need to burn all the props\u2026 without getting caught. Easy, right?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>FIGHTBACK MODE\u00a0</strong>\u2013 <i>You\u2019re not helpless this time</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue your crows and they\u2019ll help by <strong>stunning the scarecrow</strong> with a deafening cry. When it's stunned, attack fast or pay the price when it recovers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/c140a740c9b956c3525b17435a7b1d0a.poster.avif?t=1767148316\" width=616 height=175 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/c140a740c9b956c3525b17435a7b1d0a.webm?t=1767148316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>CUSTOME MODE\u00a0</strong>\u2013 <i>Your rules, your nightmare</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your own level. Choose what you face, how often, and how hard. Whether you want a casual run or pure hell, it\u2019s up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>EVERYTHING BURNS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corn, props, scarecrows, almost everything can catch fire. But be careful. The more you burn, the more they come. <strong>Fire keeps you alive</strong>, but it also <strong>brings them closer</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3d<strong> NEW MAZE EVERY TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is different. The mazes change. The threats shift. Some nights you\u2019ll feel lucky. Others, you\u2019ll barely make it out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc26\u200d\u2b1b\u00a0<strong>CROWS ARE WAITING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your crows are scared. But if you can clear the fields, they\u2019ll come. Every scarecrow you burn is a step closer to freedom for them, and maybe for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >--\u00a0<strong>CAN YOU BURN YOUR WAY OUT? --</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fields call for fire. The crows' hunger. And the scarecrows\u2026 <strong>they are waiting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>--&gt;\u00a0 CALLER OF THE CROWS\u00a0 &lt;--</strong></u></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First Harvest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3502860/867666848c9590c6c130a4e665fa3d322ce91f31.jpg"},{"name":"Extended Harvest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3502860/74f88646f5d79a03ff525509e9591383759b9294.jpg"},{"name":"Gaze of Many","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3502860/f91865fb1d1cc6c0fad3ec7dc11210d646d2968e.jpg"},{"name":"Whispers in the Corn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3502860/91739a5ebc600be5c1dfca970976cc99c50c903b.jpg"},{"name":"Echoes of Many","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3502860/5e74a09ae4a82bd9d07b9b3fa834c91960303dda.jpg"},{"name":"Rise of the Web","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3502860/fc255656bb65739e3301c7fbd8f6f6668695f55c.jpg"},{"name":"Spidey's Resign","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3502860/41cca3bb3fc455896e17488dafcc9e4cbb0549e6.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502860?t=1767148316","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502860?t=1767148316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/86aa1e73cdcd17cfe58aded15717b94ec9b20113/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767148316","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/86aa1e73cdcd17cfe58aded15717b94ec9b20113/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767148316",